<title>JAPAN: Sanwa Bank sinks to new low for year.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Bank sinks to new low for year.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanwa Bank Ltd sank to a new year-low in Wednesday afternoon trade, as foreign investors stepped up selling of the shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0548 GMT, it was down 80 yen at 1,680 yen, in a trade of 1.407 million shares, having fallen as low as 1,660 yen.</p>
